# Agent/tool config — machine-local, never commit.
# .mcp.json carries live service credentials (OneSignal app id + REST API key).
# It reached a commit once already, on the unpushed backup-feat-hard-paywall
# branch (2dd0258, 2026-06-03); this line is what stops the next `git add .`.
.mcp.json
.claude/settings.local.json
.claude/worktrees/

